<title>JAPAN: Osaka Diamond - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Osaka Diamond - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  6.49		vs	    6.48</p>
<p> Operating	  115    million    vs	  141    million</p>
<p> Current	    106    million    vs	   86    million</p>
<p> Net		   50    million    vs	   40    million</p>
<p> EPS		    2.12 yen	  vs	    2.08 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     24 million	  vs	  19 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Osaka Diamond Industrial Co Ltd is the second largest diamond-tipped tool maker.</p>
</text>
